10909							;
10910							; OSBYTE 0 (&00) Display MOS version
10911							;
10912							; OSBYTE 0 has the effect of performing a BRK instruction and
10913							; displaying the MOS version number.
10914							;
10915							; Entry parameters :
10916							;
10917							; X=0 executes a BRK and displays the OS version
10918							;
10919							; X=1 executes an RTS and returns the Operating system version
10920							;
10921							; On exit : X=<OS version>
10922							;
